28:["$","p","p-6",{"children":"PostgreSQL row versions and locks guard document invariants. Redis can coordinate an advisory lease for a background coordinator, but an expired lease holder may still run. Prometheus process metrics make memory growth and pause time visible before p99 degrades."}]
